  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenska FN-f&#xf6;rbundet verkar f&#xf6;r att m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter             respekteras, krig f&#xf6;rebyggs och millenniem&#xe5;len f&#xf6;rverkligas. Svenska  FN-f&#xf6;rbundet f&#xf6;ljer FN:s arbete och sprider kunskapen vidare till     lokala FN-f&#xf6;reningar, skolor och den svenska allm&#xe4;nheten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNA Sweden (Swedish United Nations Association) is working for a      world free from war and injustice, a world where human rights are     respected, armed conflicts are prevented, where there is social and   economic justice and where development is sustainable. UNA Sweden is  working to bring together individuals and organizations in a          cooperative effort for a better and stronger United Nations (UN).</narrative>
  </description>
